    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "I don't know why, but the baby pufferfish is always bouncing on the floor.<br />\r\nThere's never been a pause!<br />\r\nDelicate manipulation will be needed to safely take the baby pufferfish to its destination.<br />\r\nHelp baby pufferfish reach their destination safely through proper response speed and control.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt re-interpreted the classic game BouncingBall and contains several unique stages.<br />\r\nYou can play it lightly, but you can also build up your skills through many attempts if you want.<br />\r\nChallenge yourself to speedrun!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2738 50 different stage levels.<br />\r\n\u2738 Experience simple manipulation and a variety of gimmicks.<br />\r\n\u2738 Solve the puzzle using special tiles in many ways.<br />\r\n\u2738 Collect coins from every stage!<br />\r\n\u2738 Challenge Clear Record with the shortest time!",
    "about_the_game": "I don't know why, but the baby pufferfish is always bouncing on the floor.<br />\r\nThere's never been a pause!<br />\r\nDelicate manipulation will be needed to safely take the baby pufferfish to its destination.<br />\r\nHelp baby pufferfish reach their destination safely through proper response speed and control.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt re-interpreted the classic game BouncingBall and contains several unique stages.<br />\r\nYou can play it lightly, but you can also build up your skills through many attempts if you want.<br />\r\nChallenge yourself to speedrun!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2738 50 different stage levels.<br />\r\n\u2738 Experience simple manipulation and a variety of gimmicks.<br />\r\n\u2738 Solve the puzzle using special tiles in many ways.<br />\r\n\u2738 Collect coins from every stage!<br />\r\n\u2738 Challenge Clear Record with the shortest time!",
    "short_description": "Puffer bounces is an old style arcade game. The pufferfish doesn't stop and there's always a bounce on the ground. Help him move on safely with your reaction speed and proper controls.",
